{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoradio"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadio"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Particular cases","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Particular-cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A dedicated look-and-feel is implemented for that if the ","type":"text"},{"code":"isError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flag is risen.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note also the component must be instanciated with a string parameter used as accessibility label.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is a good pratice (at least) to define a label for a component without text for accessibility reasons. This label will be vocalized by ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The vocalization tool will also use, after the label, a description of the component (if disabled, if error context), and a fake trait for radio.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No accessibility identifier is defined in MISO side as this value remains in the users hands.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","text":"Cases forbidden by design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error or read only situation and a disabled component."}],"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var selection: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A simple radio, no error, not in read only mode","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\")","","    \/\/ A simple radio, but is an error context","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\", isError: true)","","    \/\/ Never disable an error-related radio button as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\", isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.4.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.12.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","b